This licence covers the source code and documentation in this repository only.
It does not extend to the third-party datasets the project analyses. SCP542,
CTRPv2, PRISM, GDSC2 and DrugBank each carry their own terms, which the user is
responsible for observing; they are recorded and referenced in
docs/steps/01-datasets-and-harmonization.md.

Two of them are more restrictive than this licence: GDSC2 / Cell Model Passports
grants internal research and educational use only and does not grant
redistribution, and DrugBank is non-commercial. No data is distributed with this
repository — the data/ directory is untracked — and it should stay that way.
